  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb with spelling change: c→qu before e to preserve the hard /k/ sound",
    "Affects yo pretérito indefinido (*me sequé*) and all subjuntivo presente forms (*me seque, te seques…*)",
    "Past participle: secado (regular)",
    "*Secarse el pelo* = to dry one's hair; *secarse las manos* = to dry one's hands",
    "Non-reflexive *secar* = to dry something: *Seca los platos* = Dry the dishes",
    "Also used for plants/rivers: *Se secó el río* = The river dried up; *La planta se secó* = The plant withered",
    "Related: seco/a (dry), la sequía (drought), el secador (hairdryer)"
  ],
